# Motion+ private registry — do not commit real tokens.
# 1. Copy to apps/web/.npmrc (or repo root .npmrc)
# 2. Replace MOTION_AUTH_TOKEN with your token from https://motion.dev/docs/react-motion-ui-installation
#
# @motionplus:registry=https://api.motion.dev/registry
# //api.motion.dev/registry/:_authToken=${MOTION_AUTH_TOKEN}
